        "_id": "OfNKDygTNCCPZUsB",
        "description": "<p>Your companion summons a ghostly pack of creatures that resemble them to fill the area. The pack can appear in and move through creatures, objects, and terrain. Once summoned, the pack moves in a straight line toward your companion until it's centered on your companion's space, then continues moving in a straight line until it is up to 20 squares away.</p><p>Your companion targets each enemy inside the pack's area during its movement once with the following power roll. If a creature is killed by this ability, their body is dragged off to Quintessence to be devoured at leisure.</p>",
